Lewis estate expired; the series would instead be rebooted with
the Netflix film Narnia: The Magician's Nephew.

31
01:24:32,727 --> 01:24:38,727
The film explores themes of space, universe,
evolution, cosmology, search for meaning.

32
01:27:16,363 --> 01:27:22,363
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
